# Converge counts colors, not mana: Black Lotus's three red mana and a Mox Sapphire's blue pay {4}{R} with only two colors, so X = 2.
# Two damage to a 0/2 Ornithopter is exactly lethal, so the excess is 0 (CR 120.10) and nothing is exiled from Bot1's library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Archaic's Agony
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

